    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d958">

                <pb facs="0945" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 815.00/1734</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Minister Leavell
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-03T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 3, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department has been informed that the Honduran Government has received intimation
                    that a large number of men guarded by soldiers are preparing a trail from the
                    Guatemalan border into Honduras in the vicinity of Omoa.</p>
                <p>You will investigate this report and ascertain the character of such activity
                    which is considered by Minister for Foreign Affairs to be actuated by a hostile
                    attempt against the present administration in Honduras.</p>
                <p>You will bring this matter to the attention of President Estrada Cabrera and
                    express the difficulty this Government feels in giving credence to the report
                    indicating that any information that he may be able to furnish will receive the
                    consideration of the Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
